To focus the first element of your form when the component loads, you can access the form controls and focus the first one. Here's how you can do it:

```typescript
// In your component
this.form.get('fieldname').focus();
```

Add this code in your `ngOnInit()` method:

```typescript
ngOnInit() {
  this.focusFirstField();
}

private focusFirstField() {
  this.form.get('fieldname').focus();
}
```

This will focus the first form field when the component is initialized.

